Description: A variance-aware framework for evaluating batch correction in omics data. Provides a SummarizedExperiment-based container that records correction and variance-decomposition provenance, harmonises multiple variance-profiling engines into a common tidy schema, and supports before/after comparison of technical and biological variance. 
